## For AI assistants

**[AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [.agents/stack.md](.agents/stack.md) are the only instruction files**;
[CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md), [GEMINI.md](GEMINI.md) and the Copilot and Cursor pointers import them. Every change
gets human review.

## Checks

The notes are an Obsidian vault: open `[[ vault_dir ]]` as a vault and start at `🏠 Home`. Design records are in
`decisions/`, indexed by `Decisions.base`.

```sh
sh scripts/checks.sh            # every check: the stack contract, the vault, scripts/check.sh
uv run scripts/check-vault.py   # front matter, embeds, design records
sh scripts/check.sh             # this repository's own checks
```

CI also runs the secret scan (`scripts/check-docs-secrets.sh`, with Docker).

This repository was generated from [template-base](https://github.com/andronics/template-base) and
[template-obsidian](https://github.com/andronics/template-obsidian). Template fixes arrive as a weekly
*Template update* PR per template.

